DESCRIPTION:Join Skip for a hands-on exploration of wearable robotics for a
 ll ages. This interactive event turns complex concepts like motors\, circui
 ts\, sensors\, and AI —into something tangible\, intuitive\, and fun. \nKid
 s will step into the role of designer and engineer\, building their own wea
 rable inventions and experimenting with how machines can enhance human move
 ment. Meanwhile\, adults will get to try MO/GO for themselves – a powered w
 earable built by Skip in partnership with Arc’teryx to make movement more e
 ffortless and joyful.  \nCome build\, play\, and experience the future of m
 ovement with us! \n  \nSchedule: \n\n5:00 – 5:30pm – Arrivals & Light Snack
 s\n5:30pm – 5:45pm – Quick remarks (Skip\, what we’re building\, overview o
 f activities for the evening)\n5:45 – 6:45 – Hands-On Stations + MO/GO Expe
 rience (rotating)\n\nLearn About Robotics Tech (motors\, sensors\, circuits
 \, …)\nDesign a Wearable\nMO/GO Experience (for the parents)\n\n\n6:45 – 7:
 00 – Show & Tell\n7:00 – 7:30 – Mingling & Drinks
