DESCRIPTION:Huge Design Studio Crawl — SFDW 2026\nWe’ve spent 15 years desi
 gning products for companies like GoPro\, Google\, Therabody\, and Bowers &
  Wilkins — and for one night during SF Design Week\, we’re opening our SoMa
  studio to the public. \nCome wander the space\, poke at prototypes\, and t
 alk shop with the team. No presentations\, no agenda — just an honest look
 at how a product idea goes from napkin sketch to something you’d actually b
 uy. Drinks are on us. \n📍 1082 Howard Street\, San Francisco\, CA 94103\n
 🕕 6:00 – 9:00 PM\n🎟 SFDW Studio Crawl Ticket Required
