 f-showcase/
CREATED:20260515T193754Z
DESCRIPTION:Women in Design SF (WID) is teaming up with Gantri to host our
 third annual showcase at SF Design Week. The showcase will exhibit works fr
 om women\, nonbinary\, and gender-expansive designers from around the Bay A
 rea. \nThe show will include a range of creative approaches and reflections
  from each designer on her multitudes—the many identities that shape her un
 ique perspective. WID is committed to creating space for women+ design voic
 es and the multi-faceted lives they lead. Come learn from these designers\,
  explore their perspectives\, and forge new community connections. \nThe ev
 ening will feature a Designer Q&A to offer insight into the process and thi
 nking behind the work.  Light refreshments will also be provided. \n  \nAge
 nda \n6:00pm Doors Open \n7:00pm Designer Q&A \n7:30pm Open Exhibit \n10:00
 pm Doors Close \n  \nCome join us for an evening of inspiration\, reflectio
 n\, and community building! \nImage Source: Sammy Creeger / Women in Design
  SF
LAST-MODIFIED:20260516T023807Z
LOCATION:Gantri The Shop\, 320 10th Street\, San Francisco\, California\, 9
 4103\, United States
