 atherine Tincher Design\, and Phase2 Builders\, with special guest Home+Spa
 ce — for a behind-the-scenes look at how we work! \nWe’re pulling out mocku
 ps\, material boards\, and recent projects (with a couple of our favorite l
 ocal vendors in the mix)\, and keeping things easy with cocktails\, bites\,
  and good conversation. \nSwing by\, say hi\, stay awhile.
