CREATED:20260515T193754Z
DESCRIPTION:Join Studio O+A for a happy hour in the studio during the crawl
 . Take a peak behind the curtain\, meet other designers\, and engage in an
 evolving dialogue about design. \nAt Studio O+A\, we thrive at the intersec
 tion of disciplines\, where diverse perspectives and crafts come together t
 o shape meaningful experiences. We believe the most impactful ideas emerge
 through collaboration—when different voices\, practices\, and ways of think
 ing intersect. \nCome be a part of that exchange and help explore what’s ne
 xt as we collectively shape the future of design.
