UID:10000590-1781287200-1781298000@sfdesignweek.org
URL:https://sfdesignweek.org/event/art-of-sport-fifa-world-cup-2026/
CREATED:20260515T193754Z
DESCRIPTION:The beautiful game. 48 beautiful posters. \nYou’re invited to t
 he launch of a new collection of 48 posters\, created by Mucho\, JP and a f
 ew global guest designers. Hosted by Mucho partner Rob Duncan and Art of Sp
 ort partner JP Stallard\, for what can only be described as a proper old-fa
 shioned “booze up.” Beers\, posters\, and every nation from this year’s Wor
 ld Cup on display. \nArt of Sport began over a decade ago\, dreamt up by fr
 iends (and football rivals) Rob and JP\, to create football posters your pa
 rtner would actually let you hang at home. Simple\, bold\, culturally tuned
 \, occasionally mischievous\, and always designed to raise a smile. Posters
  will be available to order online. \nHave a drink on us while the bar tab
 holds out and enjoy talking football. The one you kick\, not throw 😉
LAST-MODIFIED:20260516T023810Z
LOCATION:Grumpy’s Restaurant & Pub\, 125 Vallejo St.\, San Francisco Califo
 rnia\, CA\, 94111\, United States
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:Art of Sport. FIFA World Cup 2026
