 s across automotive\, fashion\, lighting\, and architecture are integrating
  AI into their creative process. Real objects and renders will be on displa
 y\, alongside the work that made them. \nExplore at your own pace: get hand
 s-on at demo stations\, watch live fabrication\, take on a prompted design
 challenge\, and spend time with a curated installation drawn from designers
  around the world. \nJune 3rd is opening night. June 11th is our closing ni
 ght. \nCome curious. Leave with something to think about.
